    {
      "title": "Row filtering versus group filtering",
      "sourceType": "lecture",
      "body": "Use `WHERE` for predicates on rows before grouping. Use `HAVING` for predicates on aggregate groups after `GROUP BY`. A robust answer also states how NULL values affect comparisons and aggregates.",
